# Build context of the Dockerfile: an allowlist of what the image copies.
# Everything else stays out, among it node_modules, website, desktop-app, ide, test,
# coverage, docs, .git, local reports and .env files.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!index.js
!index.d.ts
!ctxman.js
!LICENSE
!bin/
!lib/
!.ctxman/llm-profiles.json
!.ctxman/custom-profiles.example.json
!.ctxman/profiles/
!.ctxman/templates/
!.ctxman/wizard-profiles/

# Never, even inside the directories above
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
